[61.318535, "o", "  ok    the no-reply record is for this exact provider request\r\n"]
[61.318633, "o", "  ok    provider received this request 0 time(s) (never twice)\r\n        from the provider's records: failure (no such refund in the ledger; deadline passed before the last lookup)\r\n"]
